// A partial content match borrows a quarter of the dense term.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE part ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG part law

IMPULSE part 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "part" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
